			"height": 183,
			"weight": 172,
			"backgroundStory": "Han Zhicheng once worked as an escort guard, proud of his reputation for never abandoning a shipment. That pride ended when he obeyed an employer's order to leave wounded porters behind during an ambush. He later found shelter at a monastery and remained, taking the name Jieming as a reminder to examine his own conduct. His martial skill is formidable, but he now spends as much time teaching safe practice as fighting. He is reserved with strangers and demanding with students, yet quietly repairs their worn shoes and checks that everyone has eaten.",
